      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "放假了",
      "title_en": "A day off",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "放假", "，", "我", "不用", "上班", "。", "我", "九", "点", "起床", "，", "和", "我", "弟", "一起", "吃", "早饭", "。"],
        ["我们", "吃", "了", "面包", "，", "喝", "了", "牛奶", "。", "十", "点", "，", "我们", "一起", "出去", "走路", "。"],
        ["下午", "，", "他", "在", "家", "看", "电视", "，", "我", "在", "床", "上", "睡", "了", "一", "个", "小时", "。"],
        ["晚上", "，", "妈妈", "做", "了", "很", "多", "菜", "。", "我", "觉得", "，", "放假", "真", "好", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today's a day off, so I don't have to go to work. I got up at nine and had breakfast with my little brother.",
        "We had bread and milk. At ten we went out for a walk together.",
        "In the afternoon he watched TV at home, and I had an hour's nap in bed.",
        "In the evening Mum made lots of dishes. I think days off are great!"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["放假", "弟", "早饭"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "放假", "english": "to have a day off; holiday" },
        { "word": "弟", "english": "younger brother" },
        { "word": "早饭", "english": "breakfast" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-06-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "business & finance",
      "title_zh": "路口的饭店",
      "title_en": "The restaurant at the junction",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "家", "旁边", "的", "路口", "有", "一", "个", "饭店", "。", "这", "个", "饭店", "很", "有名", "，", "人", "很", "多", "。"],
        ["开", "饭店", "的", "人", "是", "我", "朋友", "的", "爸爸", "。", "他", "人", "很", "好", "，", "常常", "笑", "。"],
        ["他", "说", "：", "“", "东西", "好", "，", "钱", "不", "多", "，", "人", "就", "会", "来", "。", "”"],
        ["他", "的", "菜", "不", "贵", "，", "也", "很", "好吃", "。"],
        ["我", "想", "，", "我", "也", "能", "跟", "他", "学", "一点儿", "。", "我", "要", "常常", "去", "那里", "吃饭", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "There's a restaurant at the junction next to my home. It's really well known, and always busy.",
        "The man who runs it is my friend’s dad. He’s really nice and always smiling.",
        "He says: “If the food is good and the price is low, people will come.”",
        "His dishes aren't expensive, and they're delicious too.",
        "I think I could learn a thing or two from him. I’m going to eat there often!"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["路口", "有名", "一点儿"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "路口", "english": "junction; crossroads" },
        { "word": "有名", "english": "famous; well-known" },
        { "word": "一点儿", "english": "a little; a bit" }
      ]
    }
